{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》帶大家食勻中上環！節目先由施焯日（Arthur）夥拍專業食評家 Agnes 到上環品嚐精緻的「茶餚創意料理」，隨後由大廚葉世昌帶領「波波」黃婧靈走入中環的戲曲主題魯菜館，大歎由山東每日新鮮空運到港的頂級奢華名菜！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">首站二人來到上環的本地茶飲及茶餚品牌。樓下的茶飲店主打16款自家研發茶飲，招牌「重焙烏龍茶鴛鴦」特別選用了帶獨特花香與明亮酸質的埃塞俄比亞咖啡豆，結合高溫烘焙、醇厚回甘的重焙烏龍茶，施焯日更建議食客大啖入口，一次過品嚐三個層次的醇香口感。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">至於樓上的茶餚餐廳則帶來多款以茶入菜的精緻料理：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">離念茶蒔</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：上環皇后大道中286號地舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"4996be0e-ab4c-4f3f-82d4-913a85138e29.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20260A5JFbquiX1787108768.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4996be0e-ab4c-4f3f-82d4-913a85138e29.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"3ef8135c-ad2b-4290-b48d-f4f7097aa3fa.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026kptKuZQSeB1787108768.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3ef8135c-ad2b-4290-b48d-f4f7097aa3fa.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"998904c7-0c72-4829-88fb-5f7502c2a394.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026J2GfRrkxRJ1787108767.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"998904c7-0c72-4829-88fb-5f7502c2a394.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"80309e30-c807-4917-8d68-edfbca428492.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026XcC1tOVBfc1787108767.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"80309e30-c807-4917-8d68-edfbca428492.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"9fb62366-e522-4061-a58b-d69d14727291.png.webp\" src=\"https: